This repository records, but does not vendor, task definitions from two public benchmarks.
The task manifests under benchmark/upstream/ reproduce each upstream task id and instruction
verbatim, with the pinned commit and a SHA-256 per task file and per evaluator file. Myco
runs the upstream evaluator code from a pinned checkout; it does not redistribute it.
Details, including the status of per-task file assets: docs/benchmark/upstream/README.md.

